<section id="education" class="education">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="education__title">Education</h2>
    <p class="education__intro-text">The combination of visual design training and a teaching background has shaped how I communicate and document design decisions, something that's proven especially valuable when building design systems and aligning teams around shared standards.</p>
    <div class="education__grid">

      <div class="education__col">
        <h3>Formal Education</h3>
        <p class="education__date">2003 – 2009</p>
        <p class="education__item">Teaching Degree in Arts<br> <span class="education__place">at the Faculty of Arts of UNLP<br />(National University of La Plata)</span></p>

        <p class="education__date">1999 – 2003</p>
        <p class="education__item">Visual Communication Design<br> <span class="education__place">at the Faculty of Arts of UNLP<br />(National University of La Plata)</span></p>
      </div>

      <div class="education__col">
        <h3>Courses</h3>
        <p class="education__date">May 2022</p>
        <p class="education__item">Web Accessibility Course <br> <span class="education__place">at Udemy</span></p>

        <p class="education__date">Mar 2021</p>
        <p class="education__item">Product Discovery Course<br> <span class="education__place">at Product Hub</span></p>

        <p class="education__date">Feb 2017</p>
        <p class="education__item">Product Design Course<br> <span class="education__place">With Sol Metz</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="education__col">
        <h3>UX/UI Skills</h3>
        <p class="education__item">Tools</p>
        <p class="education__skills">Figma, FigJam, Adobe Illustrator, Confluence, Notion, Jira, Zeplin, Storybook</p>
        <p class="education__item">Design Systems</p>
        <p class="education__skills">Component libraries, Design tokens, Documentation, Contribution & versioning workflows</p>
        <p class="education__item">UX Practice</p>
        <p class="education__skills">User research, Usability testing, Prototyping, Wireframing, Design-engineering handoff</p>
      </div>

      <div class="education__col">
        <h3>Languages</h3>
        <a href="#" class="education__item">Spanish</a>
        <p class="education__place">Native</p>
        <a href="#" class="education__item">English</a>
        <p class="education__place">Upper intermediate</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../styles/tokens' as *;

  .education {
    padding: $space-24 0;

    &__title {
      font-size: $font-size-h2;
      margin-bottom: $space-6;
    }
    &__intro-text{
      margin-bottom: $space-8;

    }
    &__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: $space-8;
    }

    &__col {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: $space-2;

      h3 {
        font-size: $font-size-body;
        font-weight: $font-weight-black;
        margin-bottom: $space-4;
      }
    }
    p{line-height: 1.2rem;}
    &__date {
      font-size: $font-size-small;
      color: $color-text-light;
      margin-top: $space-3;
    }

    &__item {
      color: $color-accent;
      font-weight: $font-weight-bold;
      font-size: $font-size-medium;
    }

    &__place, &__skills {
      font-size: $font-size-small;
      font-weight: $font-weight-regular;
      color: $color-text;
    }

    &__label {
      font-size: $font-size-small;
      font-weight: $font-weight-bold;
      color: $color-primary;
      margin-top: $space-4;
    }
  }
</style>